Description: Soundboard for GNOME with virtual microphone support
 Vinheta is a soundboard for the GNOME desktop. Each directory added by
 the user becomes a tab, and every sound in it can be played with a click.
 .
 Sounds are played on the audio output and can also be sent to a virtual
 microphone, so they can be heard by other people in calls.
